cdx?url=pubs.rsc.org/en/content/articlehtml/2026/dd/d6dd00260a&output=json.\n\nAlso try CORE: https://core.ac.uk/search/?q=%22Benchmarking%20Machine%20Learning%20and%20Molecular%20Dynamics%20Methods%22 .\n\nLet me do these in parallel."
